      "message": "Alice\u0027s comment was around making it part of `PartialInput`, the primary consumer of which is instance image module, which is different.\n\nIIUC, yours is about encapsulating the hidden input to dice into a structure \u0026 passing it to `write_next_bcc`, which would imply:\n1. either having a wrapper around `write_next_bcc`\n2. or making `make_hidden` public\n3. or moving make_hidden into the caller\n\nThe 3rd would have been pragmatic, since that would mean dice.rs would have just be a pvmfw\u0027s dice module almost replicating the general dice system. But unfortunately, the current code structure does not allow that for ex. `rkp_vm_marker` is field of PartialInput \u0026 the method `write_next_bcc` is a method in `PartialInput`, neither of which make any sense to me.\n\nAnywho, thats for some later refactoring.",
